    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/ed1dc27dd97026662f1d566643125b3c.poster.avif?t=1726934299\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/ed1dc27dd97026662f1d566643125b3c.webm?t=1726934299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/ed1dc27dd97026662f1d566643125b3c.mp4?t=1726934299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2>Randomly generated floors with unique loot capable of improving your defenses.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/c4f9f8372c23929e91ad1f79d426b338.poster.avif?t=1726934299\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/c4f9f8372c23929e91ad1f79d426b338.webm?t=1726934299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/c4f9f8372c23929e91ad1f79d426b338.mp4?t=1726934299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARVEST</strong></h2>Extract resources from vegetation, soil and human-made litter to craft powerful machines. Utilize your squads of vegetables to discover rooms and dig out terrain.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/7d66f1ed768de0dca2d8c74c36eb86f3.poster.avif?t=1726934299\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/7d66f1ed768de0dca2d8c74c36eb86f3.webm?t=1726934299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/7d66f1ed768de0dca2d8c74c36eb86f3.mp4?t=1726934299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2>Craft machines to form intricate mazes and funnel pests into their demise. The floors are randomly generated with unique loot capable of improving your defenses.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/19526515201c030515a1e582731b822c.poster.avif?t=1726934299\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/19526515201c030515a1e582731b822c.webm?t=1726934299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851260/extras/19526515201c030515a1e582731b822c.mp4?t=1726934299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE</strong></h2>Resurface with curiosities found when delving to unlock new machines and more... or choose to dig deeper!",
